meta {
  name: Pages - List
  type: http
  seq: 84
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a page space>/pages?limit=500&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  limit: 500
  offset: 0
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The pages of a page space, in their order (#1179), without their text. Offset pagination (limit, offset; metadata.pagination): the default and largest limit is 500, the cap of the pages of a space, and an offset over 500 counts as 500. Members who can read the space. Ability pages:read.
  Public: in a public space this request works without a session and without a token (the response carries the name, username and avatar of the authors, never more). Every other space answers 401 without an account.
}
